abstract: >-
  Frozen synthetic inputs and evaluation records: 470 D01 deterministic replays,
  50 separate D02 post-hoc replays, and eight final D03 cases with 32 raw model
  responses. Earlier Phase B development runs remain separate. Integrity
  verification is not evidence of independent external reproduction.
